OL,3,AFar-right Israeli lawmaker damages
OL,4,APalestinian memorial with sledgehammer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA far-right member of the Israeli
OL,7,Fparliament has badly damaged a
OL,8,FPalestinian memorial with a
OL,9,Fsledgehammer in the occupied West Bank
OL,10,Fwhile under military escort.
OL,12,FThe incident has drawn strong criticism
OL,13,Ffrom Palestinians and across the
OL,14,Fpolitical spectrum in Israel.
OL,16,FVideo footage showed Zvi Sukkot, a
OL,17,Fmember of the far-right Religious
OL,18,FZionism party, and several others
OL,19,Fstriking the stone memorial in the
OL,20,FPalestinian village of Madama.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
