OL,3,AFar-right Israeli lawmaker damages
OL,4,APalestinian memorial with sledgehammer
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the video, Sukkot - who has a
OL,7,Fhistory of provocative anti-Palestinian
OL,8,Facts - says: "This is something we
OL,9,Fcannot leave standing here, because any
OL,10,Fplace that glorifies terrorism, we must
OL,11,Fremove it."
